---
import DocsLayout from '../../layouts/DocsLayout.astro';
---

<DocsLayout
  title="Terminal CLI Reference"
  description="Complete command-line interface documentation for the Beberes utility on macOS."
>
  <div class="prose prose-zinc dark:prose-invert max-w-none">
    <div class="border-b border-zinc-200 dark:border-zinc-800 pb-6 mb-8">
      <span class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-emerald-600 dark:text-emerald-400">Command Line</span>
      <h1 class="text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight text-zinc-900 dark:text-white mt-1">
        Terminal CLI Reference
      </h1>
      <p class="text-base text-zinc-600 dark:text-zinc-400 mt-2">
        Beberes can be operated entirely from your favorite terminal shell (<code class="font-mono text-xs">zsh</code>, <code class="font-mono text-xs">bash</code>, <code class="font-mono text-xs">fish</code>) or scheduled as a cron job.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Installation -->
    <section class="mb-10">
      <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-zinc-900 dark:text-zinc-100">Installation & Setup</h2>
      <p class="text-sm text-zinc-600 dark:text-zinc-400 mt-2">
        The CLI is bundled inside the native application bundle. You can symlink it into your system PATH:
      </p>
      <div class="mt-3 rounded-lg bg-zinc-950 p-4 font-mono text-xs text-zinc-200 border border-zinc-800 overflow-x-auto">
        sudo ln -sf /Applications/Beberes.app/Contents/MacOS/beberes-app /usr/local/bin/beberes
      </div>
      <p class="text-xs text-zinc-500 mt-2">
        Alternatively, open <strong>Beberes Settings</strong> in the GUI and click <strong>Install CLI Tool</strong> to configure this automatically.
      </p>
    </section>

    <!-- General Syntax -->
    <section class="mb-10">
      <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-zinc-900 dark:text-zinc-100">Command Syntax</h2>
      <div class="mt-3 rounded-lg bg-zinc-950 p-4 font-mono text-xs text-zinc-200 border border-zinc-800 overflow-x-auto">
        beberes &lt;COMMAND&gt; [OPTIONS]
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Commands Table -->
    <section class="mb-10">
      <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-zinc-900 dark:text-zinc-100">Available Commands</h2>
      <div class="mt-4 space-y-6">

        <!-- scan -->
        <div class="rounded-xl border border-zinc-200 dark:border-zinc-800 bg-zinc-50/50 dark:bg-zinc-900/40 p-5">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-2 font-mono text-sm font-semibold text-emerald-600 dark:text-emerald-400">
            <span>beberes scan</span>
          </div>
          <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-zinc-600 dark:text-zinc-400">
            Performs a system scan of temporary caches, application logs, and developer directories.
          </p>
          <div class="mt-3 bg-zinc-950 p-3 rounded font-mono text-xs text-zinc-300 border border-zinc-800">
            beberes scan --json
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- clean -->
        <div class="rounded-xl border border-zinc-200 dark:border-zinc-800 bg-zinc-50/50 dark:bg-zinc-900/40 p-5">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-2 font-mono text-sm font-semibold text-emerald-600 dark:text-emerald-400">
            <span>beberes clean [OPTIONS]</span>
          </div>
          <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-zinc-600 dark:text-zinc-400">
            Executes cleanup for safe cache categories.
          </p>
          <div class="mt-3 space-y-2">
            <div class="text-xs text-zinc-500 font-semibold">Options:</div>
            <ul class="text-xs text-zinc-600 dark:text-zinc-300 font-mono space-y-1 list-disc pl-5">
              <li><span class="text-emerald-500">--dry-run</span>: Print what would be removed without deleting anything.</li>
              <li><span class="text-emerald-500">--force</span>: Bypass confirmation prompts.</li>
              <li><span class="text-emerald-500">--permanent</span>: Delete directly instead of moving to macOS Trash.</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- kill-port -->
        <div class="rounded-xl border border-zinc-200 dark:border-zinc-800 bg-zinc-50/50 dark:bg-zinc-900/40 p-5">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-2 font-mono text-sm font-semibold text-emerald-600 dark:text-emerald-400">
            <span>beberes kill-port &lt;PORT_NUMBER&gt;</span>
          </div>
          <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-zinc-600 dark:text-zinc-400">
            Finds and kills the process occupying the specified TCP or UDP port.
          </p>
          <div class="mt-3 bg-zinc-950 p-3 rounded font-mono text-xs text-zinc-300 border border-zinc-800">
            beberes kill-port 3000
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- hibernate -->
        <div class="rounded-xl border border-zinc-200 dark:border-zinc-800 bg-zinc-50/50 dark:bg-zinc-900/40 p-5">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-2 font-mono text-sm font-semibold text-emerald-600 dark:text-emerald-400">
            <span>beberes hibernate &lt;DIRECTORY&gt;</span>
          </div>
          <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-zinc-600 dark:text-zinc-400">
            Recursively locates inactive Git projects inside the target directory and clears heavy dependencies.
          </p>
          <div class="mt-3 bg-zinc-950 p-3 rounded font-mono text-xs text-zinc-300 border border-zinc-800">
            beberes hibernate ~/Developer --days 60
          </div>
        </div>

      </div>
    </section>
  </div>
</DocsLayout>
